Package: aegis-firewall
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nftables, iproute2
Recommends: tor, i2pd, dnsmasq, wireguard-tools, openvpn, obfs4proxy
Suggests: resolvconf
Description: Aegis OS fail-closed firewall and network-mode switcher
 Provides /usr/sbin/aegis-firewall and the aegis-netmode service, which apply the
 selected network mode at boot and on demand:
  * tor    - fail-closed transparent Tor firewall; all TCP/DNS via Tor, leaks dropped
  * i2p    - tight firewall + i2pd SOCKS/HTTP proxies on localhost
  * both   - Tor transparent routing plus the i2pd proxies
  * direct - plain stateful firewall, no forced anonymity routing
 .
 The active mode is read from /etc/aegis/netmode (default: tor).
